  "$comment": "DEVELOPMENT descriptor for the deberta_decision family (hfmodels-litert, not in the bundled catalog). Generated by tools/hfmodels_descriptor.py from the Hub at the pinned revision: every file's bytes and sha256 are the Hub's. The device gate side-loads the published files from /data/local/tmp/hfmodels/open-decision (DebertaDecisionDeviceTest). The draft for the repo's own hfmodels.json (without the top-level revision). One development variant after the published two: s256_npu_wfp16 is the S256 graph re-authored for the Qualcomm HTP in the typed-decisions speed round r12 (OD-B, 2026-10-04: a -1e4 attention-mask constant, LayerNorm power-of-two pre-scale with a per-norm k from the fp32 range profile, FC1 of all 24 FFNs split into two FULLY_CONNECTED joined by CONCATENATION; exact in fp32, the same I/O contract, table and tokenizer as s256_wfp16), a local file that is not on the Hub (its bytes and sha256 are the export's, ~/code/standup/handoffs/assets/2026-10-03-typed-decisions/r12-report.md), with an npu profile asked for by name (BackendPolicy.Require, no fallback; gpu stays the default).",
